{"synopsis":"Dari Studio yang membawakan Damn Reincarnation Player Who Returned 10000 Years Later dan beberapa judul menarik lainnya.\n\n﻿\n\nSetiap manusia yang berusia antara 15 tahun sampai 25 tahun di seluruh dunia diwajibkan untuk berpartisipasi dalam death game permainan maut yang terdiri dari 20 ronde.\n\n\n\nRyu Min berdiri sendirian di depan pintu masuk ronde terakhir Namun dia tidak bisa melanjutkannya karena tidak memenuhi persyaratan untuk memasuki ronde tersebut dengan 5 orang.\n\n﻿\n\nSekarang pada percobaan yang ke100 dan terakhirnya dia menggunakan informasi yang sudah dia dapatkan dari 99 percobaan sebelumnya untuk membantu mengumpulkan rekan yang diperlukan guna memasuki ronde terakhir.\n\n﻿\n\nDapatkah Ryu Min menyelesaikan game ini atau apakah dia akan berakhir di pertengahan jalan.","alternative_title":"만렙 플레이어의 100번째 회귀","author":"Yeoun, King Soda","artist":"Duckf, Terapin","chapters":[{"number":"89","chapter":"89","slug":"8c9363ff-bfbf-4cf9-96e8-1792945c64e3","title":"Chapter 89","date":"2026-06-30"},{"number":"88","chapter":"88","slug":"a6ed2e6e-c773-4bfd-a646-56b6ccd756ce","title":"Chapter 88","date":"2026-06-23"},{"number":"87","chapter":"87","slug":"df642091-a60e-4d88-9f8f-848e0366f4c5","title":"Chapter 87","date":"2026-06-16"},{"number":"86","chapter":"86","slug":"beda2f4a-bd3a-4c32-80cb-bd0ceb03e2b0","title":"Chapter 86","date":"2026-06-02"},{"number":"85","chapter":"85","slug":"296ab5b7-72e5-4d4c-bc57-f30eac81e115","title":"Chapter 85","date":"2026-05-26"},{"number":"84","chapter":"84","slug":"49c49c12-faa3-4ea2-896c-94d0546529ba","title":"Chapter 84","date":"2026-05-19"},{"number":"83","chapter":"83","slug":"02424ae6-9d14-4dd0-84f1-39a85f7ddce5","title":"Chapter 83","date":"2026-05-13"},{"number":"82","chapter":"82","slug":"56b5bf1a-7d8f-4f98-8981-a49790c53cd5","title":"Chapter 82","date":"2026-05-13"},{"number":"81","chapter":"81","slug":"097030d9-13dd-47da-83ff-516bb39cdc0b","title":"Chapter 81","date":"2025-12-23"},{"number":"80","c